but u may get more less stable result\n\nNow u can use 720p (1280x720) to generate FLF2V videos , results will be good in more cases\n\nuse CFG 1.0 to get faster generation or use CFG 2.0 to get more cool result, but generation takes more time if cfg>1. With CFG 2.0 u necessarily write negative prompt (cfg 1 doesn't reqiuere negative prompt)\n\nRecomended resolution: 576x1024, 1024x576, 1280x720, 720x1280\n\nHow to set length (frames) correctly:\n\nfor 16 fps\n16 * number of seconds = length and set frame_rate 16 on Video Combine\n\nfor 24 fps\n24 * number of seconds = length and set frame_rate 24 on Video Combine\n\nTry generate videos more than 5 seconds because u have more sources (2 images)\n\nI recomend leave 8 steps with 4steps loras, but u can try set 10 steps - you may get better result\n\nIf u want generate more dynamic video with minimum artefacts, turn off lightx loras, set 20 steps in 480p or 30 steps in 720p, cfg from 3.5 to 5 to each ksampler \n\nTry adjusting WanVideoBlockSwap settings\n\nMy results with rtx 5080 generation\n\nWith 4steps loras\n576p, light Lora 250928, 81 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 5-6 minutes\n720p, light Lora 250928, 81 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 10-11 minutes\n576p, light Lora 250928, 129 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 8 minutes\n720p, light Lora 250928, 129 length (16 fps), 10 steps, unipc, cfg 2.0 (high noise only) ≈ 15-16 minutes\n\nWithout LightX\n480p, 81 length (16 fps), 20 steps, unipc, cfg 3.5 ≈ 10 minutes\n720p, 81 length (16 fps), 30 steps, unipc, cfg 3.5 ≈ 35 minutes\n\n\n\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":202,"type":"Note","pos":[-2426.1328125,-626.4688720703125],"size":[989.5694580078125,508.8308410644531],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Models and .whl files","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.1","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Required models for WAN 2.2 FirstLastFrame2Video Workflow:\n\nWAN 2.2 I2V Models:  https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy_fp8_scaled/tree/main/I2V\nLightning Lora 4steps: https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning/tree/main/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-4steps-lora-250928 (i recomend rename files while you're downloading them)\nText Encoder: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/blob/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors\nVAE: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/blob/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n\n(Optional) NSFW WAN 2.2 Lora - https://civitai.com/models/1307155?modelVersionId=2073605 and https://civitai.com/models/1811313/wan-dr34ml4y-all-in-one-nsfw\n\nIf you need GGUF Version - https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/Wan2.2-I2V-A14B-GGUF/tree/main\nI recomend use lightx lora instead 4 steps high and low noise lora for GGUF models and set strength 1 - https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Lightx2v/lightx2v_T2V_14B_cfg_step_distill_v2_lora_rank256_bf16.safetensors\nOnly UNIPC Sampler\n\n\nFile save location\n\nComfyUI/\n├───📂 models/\n│   ├───📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├─── Wan2_2-I2V-A14B_HIGH_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.safetensors\n│   │   └─── Wan2_2-I2V-A14B-LOW_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.safetensors\n│   ├───📂 loras/\n│   │   ├───high_noise_model.safetensors\n│   │   ├───low_noise_model.safetensors\n│   ├───📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └─── umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors \n│   └───📂 vae/\n│       └── wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n\nSageAttention.whl - https://github.com/woct0rdho/SageAttention/releases/tag/v2.2.0-windows. To install sageattention, u can .whl change to .zip and:\n1. If u don't have sageattention, just put folders from .zip to ComfyUI\\python_embeded\\Lib\\site-packages\n2. If u have older version sageattention, delete folders with sageattention in ComfyUI\\python_embeded\\Lib\\site-packages and put new folders from .zip\n\nTo install Triton (if u don't have Triton) go to ComfyUI\\python_embeded and install by command [pip install triton] via cmd\n\nif you got error BaseLoaderKJ._patch_modules.<locals>.attention_sage() got an unexpected keyword argument 'transformer_options', use run_nvidia_gpu - sageattention.bat instead run_nvidia_gpu.bat in ComfyUI from .zip archive\n\n\n\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":205,"type":"Label (rgthree)","pos":[-640.5399169921875,-1047.3233642578125],"size":[1700.537109375,150],"flags":{"allow_interaction":true},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Wan 2.2 FLF2V Workflow","properties":{"fontSize":150,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontColor":"#ffd000","textAlign":"left","backgroundColor":"transparent","padding":0,"borderRadius":0,"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.1","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"color":"#fff0","bgcolor":"#fff0"},{"id":204,"type":"Label (rgthree)","pos":[-2258.453369140625,-744.7561645507812],"size":[730.810546875,50],"flags":{"allow_interaction":true},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Notes (Recomend it for a review)","properties":{"fontSize":50,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontColor":"#ffffff","textAlign":"left","backgroundColor":"transparent","padding":0,"borderRadius":0,"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.1","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"color":"#fff0","bgcolor":"#fff0"},{"id":209,"type":"UnetLoaderGGUFDisTorch2MultiGPU","pos":[-1392.562298866469,100.62215447721337],"size":[335.644140625,178],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"compute_device","name":"compute_device","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"compute_device"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"virtual_vram_gb","name":"virtual_vram_gb","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"virtual_vram_gb"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"donor_device","name":"donor_device","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"donor_device"},"lin